OL,3,GNEWSABeauty spot inappropriate campers
OL,4,Amoved on
OL,5,
OL,6,FNumerous people camping inappropriately
OL,7,Fin the Lake District have been moved on
OL,8,Fover the summer, a council has
OL,9,Frevealed.
OL,11,FAs part of its enforcement activity
OL,12,FCumberland Council officials "engaged
OL,13,Fwith over 100 people", and in the last
OL,14,Ftwo weeks removed 10 campsites.
OL,16,FIt has also issued a number of fixed
OL,17,Fpenalty notices - in one case after a
OL,18,Fvehicle drive across a Site of Specific
OL,19,FScientific Interest (SSSI) to set up
OL,20,Fcamp on a lake shore causing damage to
OL,21,Fthe ground.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
