OL,3,GNEWSABeauty spot inappropriate campers
OL,4,Amoved on
OL,5,
OL,6,FA public awareness campaign has also
OL,7,Fbeen launched to remind campers and
OL,8,Fvisitors to leave no trace and take
OL,9,Ftheir litter home, with signs installed
OL,10,Fin locations such as Keswick and
OL,11,FWasdale.
